<title>UK: UK financial markets unaffected by Treasury fire.</title>
<headline>UK financial markets unaffected by Treasury fire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British financial markets were unaffected by the fire at the Treasury on Tuesday.</p>
<p>All the Treasury's direct dealings with financial markets take place via the Bank of England which is functioning as usual.</p>
<p>The London Fire Brigade reported a &quot;large fire&quot; at the Treasury building earlier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman added &quot;it is a serious blaze and not yet under control.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
